msgstr "隐藏梦之灵上的 200 数字（仅限 EXE4-6）。"

msgid "Dark buster arm (EXE5)"
msgstr "恶洛克人手炮同步配色（EXE5）"

msgid "Match EXE5 MegaMan's buster arm palette to his light/dark body (Normal, Sol Cross, and Bass Cross)."
msgstr "在 EXE5 中使洛克人手炮颜色与本体善恶配色同步（含普通、太阳交错与佛鲁迪交错）。"

msgid "The stage reaches the window's edges, the HUD with it."
msgstr "场景延伸到窗口边缘，HUD 也随之靠边。"

msgid "HD chip art"
msgstr "高清体验"

msgid "Use Legacy Collection high-resolution chip artwork and element icons when available."
msgstr "可用时使用合集版高清芯片卡图、属性图标及交错选择等高清素材。"

msgid "HD art archive"
msgstr "高清体验文件"

msgid "Select launcher/data/vol2.dat, exe/data/exe6.dat, or exe/data/exe6f.dat from Battle Network Legacy Collection Vol. 2."
msgstr "选择《洛克人EXE 合集 Vol.2》中的 launcher/data/vol2.dat、exe/data/exe6.dat 或 exe/data/exe6f.dat 文件。"

