msgstr "立即检查"

msgid "You're on the latest version."
msgstr "当前已是最新版本。"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates."
msgstr "无法检查更新。"

msgid "Auto-upload replays"
msgstr "自动上传对战录像"

msgid "Automatically upload finished online replays to the server's Recent Replays feed. Off by default."
msgstr "联机对战结束后自动上传录像至服务器，用于「近日录像」浏览。默认关闭，随时可关。"

