msgstr "在 EXE5 默认对战中优先播放 5DS 重编战斗音乐（需配置 EXE5DS ROM）。"

msgid "EXE5DS battle voices"
msgstr "EXE5DS 战斗语音"

msgid "Play DS battle voices in EXE5 (requires EXE5DS ROM)."
msgstr "在 EXE5 对战中播放 5DS 战斗语音（需配置 EXE5DS ROM）。"

msgid "EXE5DS Crisis Microphone"
msgstr "EXE5DS 危机麦克风"

